@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Labour Party**</span> to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Labour Party**</span>. This has rankled the Labour Right.

@Interview_with_the_Financial_Times
title: Interview with the Financial Times
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> as well as the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; kpd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if kpd_cooperation_seen <= 1; kpd_cooperation_seen += 1

McDonnell's special advisors organise a landmark interview with the Financial Times, minorly reducing dissent from capital and increasing PMC support.

@the_treasury_
title: The Treasury
subtitle: As Chancellor of the Exchequer, McDonnell can enact tax policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> not in government: ?] [? if finance_minister_party != "SPD" : The <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> does not control the finance ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and finance_minister_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@public_ownership_
title: Public Ownership
subtitle: Enact policies to build a more democratic economy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" or (finance_minister_party != "SPD" and economic_minister_party != "SPD") : We do not have the necessary government ministers. ?] [? if cvp_economy_accepted : Our coalition agreement stipulates against socialization. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "SPD" or finance_minister_party == "SPD") and (labor_minister_party == "SPD")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_democracy
